Methods we re-implemented (credited, no code copied):
- Diffusion Transformer with adaLN-zero conditioning: Peebles & Xie, "Scalable Diffusion Models with Transformers"
  (2023). The DiT repository is CC BY-NC 4.0; none of its code is included here.
- FVD protocol: Unterthiner et al. (2018); StyleGAN-V (Skorokhodov et al., 2022) evaluation settings.
- Image-to-video by first-frame replacement: STIV; SANA-Video.
- Rectified flow / flow matching: Liu et al. (2022); Lipman et al. (2022).

